title: FortiGate Services License Expiry
agents: fortigate
catalog: network/fortinet
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check inspects the web filtering subsection of FortiOS GET /monitor/license/status?vdom=root and reports how many days
 remain before the license expires. The default thresholds are WARN at 30 days remaining and CRIT at 15 days (or once the
 license has already expired); both day thresholds are configurable via the "FortiGate Services License expiry thresholds"
 check-parameters ruleset.
item:
 This check has no item. One service is discovered per FortiGate host when a web_filtering license entry is present.
group: Licensing
perfdata:
 days_until_webfilter_expiry: Number of days remaining before the web filtering license expires (negative once expired).
